WEBVTT

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:47.670
We'll be much better off taking cover.{We'll be much better off in here.}{We're better off than out in the open back there.}

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:51.290
Is there a chance he'll disappear if we just buy time?

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:55.650
They probably offered all three of our lives to summon him.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.800
He'll likely keep rampaging until he's satisfied.{kills us.}

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:04.560
Then if we break the barrier and reunite with the others...

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.310
No.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:09.530
Chaos fights by summoning 
any number of heroic spirits...

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:11.560
According to the legends.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:15.570
We should consider it likely that there's 
fighting going on outside the barrier, as well.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:20.070
We'll just have to do something about him on our own!

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.120
You're welcome to resist if you'd like.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:38.670
It's not as if you two can match up to me in this situation anyway.

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:49.310
Did you think we hadn't even started yet?

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:50.690
What the...?

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:54.740
This is miasma from the demon that drains your life force.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.400
See how even a succubus suffers?

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.490
Since you're human, it must be quite hard on you.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.200
C-Coward!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.950
Just stay there and relax.{relax where you are.}

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:11.550
The more you move, the worse you'll suffer.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.970
<i>I won't let him!</i>

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.370
Prepare yourself!

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:45.990
I'll destroy anyone who threatens Basara-sama and his friends lives!

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.650
Banishing Shift!

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.160
Tch. This is troublesome.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:27.530
Dammit!

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:35.790
Mio!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:40.580
Basara!

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:42.800
Here he comes!

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:17.080
Please don't pass out just yet.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:21.090
At least not until you've watched your cute little sister die.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.590
Kurumi...   {ktime}{Would probably look a bit cheesy. - Editor}

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.090
Now, this time

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:30.100
I'll make sure I kill you.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.880
I see.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.250
So you're the one who went after Rukia-neesama and Yuki-san.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:45.710
M-My hand! My...!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:49.470
How impudent.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:52.370
After harming both of them, 
you went after Kurumi-san, too?

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.090
Kurumi-san is my precious to—

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:59.330
my friend!

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:02.670
A-A lowly succubus dares to—

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.380
No!

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:08.760
Maria...

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:12.670
You almost called me your toy just now, didn't you?

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.250
You...

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.520
How dare you hurt Onee!

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:42.880
To think you tried to attack Kurumi-san in her sleep right before my eyes.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.160
That's just taking it too far.{You went a bit too far.}

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.770
It's all right... It's all right.    {ktime?}{Yeah, I agree for this one. - Editor}

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.700
Lars!

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:26.250
Jeez, pulling stunts like this...

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:35.810
Don't get so full of yourselves, you puppets!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.160
Are you all right?

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.170
Ramsus-san?!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.690
If you have time to worry about me,

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:47.940
then think of some way to deal with that monster!

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:51.290
Deal with him? How...

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:53.450
No, there is a way!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.380
The reason Chaos can't leave that space

00:07:57.170 --> 00:08:00.850
is that gravity magic is acting on the space around it,

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:04.690
creating a dimensional fault that he can't cross.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:06.460
In other words,

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:12.550
a gravity-based attack might be able to seal him into another dimension.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:13.630
You mean...

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:15.940
A black hole.

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:22.680
Create that black hole from before once more and suck him into it.

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:24.230
So,

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:28.590
It only has to be for a short moment, 
but please restrain him from moving.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:29.230
Sure.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:32.740
In that opening, Mio will need to create her black hole.

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:36.240
Then I'll push him into it.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.580
Let's try it.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:42.440
Mio, I'm going to unleash my limiters.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:44.420
This time, all three.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:47.080
I'm sorry.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:49.590
I didn't want to do it for the first time at a crucial moment.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:52.880
But this is the only way.

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.390
Believe in me once more!

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:01.920
When this is all over, let's go home.

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:03.960
With everyone.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:04.920
Yeah.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.900
Let's go, Basara!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.710
<i>On my pride as the Demon Lord,</i>

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:18.120
<i>I promise to stop him in his tracks.</i>

00:09:25.070 --> 00:09:29.580
<i>Don't think a relic of the past
 like you can destroy us that easily!</i>

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:50.730
Mio!

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:14.500
<i>Basara!</i>

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:22.970
<i>Mio!</i>

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.230
<i>Basara-sama.</i>

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.340
Disappear!

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:03.010
To another dimension!

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:00.100
No way...

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.320
They defeated Chaos?!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.990
Then we'll have to use our last resort.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:12.560
This will turn everyone inside the barrier to dust.  {Now everyone in there shall be turned to dust.}

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:14.520
To our victory!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:24.090
Ta-da!  {ktime something?}

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:27.310
Onee-chan makes her gallant appearance.

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:34.650
But it's your fault, old men.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:37.640
Trying to dispose of my Leo-kun...

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:42.250
And here Onee-chan was letting you all live out of the profound kindness of her heart.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:47.620
Hey, how long are you going to keep hiding there?

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.780
Come out already.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:53.370
Or would you prefer to be dragged out?

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.720
Good grief,

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.200
you noticed me?

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:59.380
What a scary young lady.

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:03.040
I thought heroic spirits were sent to Wildart, as well.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:06.640
You certainly are an incredible god of war.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.270
I'm the one shaking over here.

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:12.620
I thought I'd completely {eliminated}concealed my presence.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:16.330
Onee-chan has a very strong woman's intuition.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:20.900
But you're not very friendly, Mr. War God{alt: War God-san}.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.770
You came here to kill these old men, too, didn't you?

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:28.160
Yet you left Onee-chan with all the work.

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:32.080
What do you have to keep fed inside of you

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:35.290
to give off such a monstrous aura?

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:40.590
You're one to talk{ about others}, Mr. War God{alt: War God-san}.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:44.550
I smell a dragon around you.

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:48.810
One of the ancient, high-ranking dragons, too.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.710
But that solves the mystery of how

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:56.500
your son is able to use that dimensional shift.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.440
Oh?

00:13:57.440 --> 00:14:01.990
That's because he's inherited your blood... right, Mr. War God{alt: War God-san}?

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:06.430
Hmm, what should I do?

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:08.860
Maybe I should take care of that boy now.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.500
Hey, lady...

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:16.500
I'd prefer to remain no more than insurance until the end this time.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.700
That's no good, Mr. War God{alt: War God-san}.

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:20.710
If you're going to be like that,

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:24.780
then I'll only have more people I need to eliminate for Leo-kun's sake.

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:34.390
Dad?! Wh-What?!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:39.190
My, Onee-chan's a bit impressed right now.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:41.470
I'm surprised you managed to make it here.

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:43.150
Huh? No...

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:46.190
Huh?

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.360
Did you come here for the same reason as your father?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.160
No...

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:51.670
Hmm...

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.470
<i>I guess you didn't come on your own.</i>

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.160
How interesting.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.370
Don't worry, Mr. War God{alt: War God-san}.

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:07.280
Onee-chan doesn't intend to cause a stir here.

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:10.550
Um, may I call you "Basara-kun"?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:13.680
You seem to get along awfully well with Lars.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:18.730
Now that all the old men on the council are gone,

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:21.900
I hope you'll start getting along 
with Leo-kun more, as well, okay?

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.060
U-Uh?

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:27.570
I'll see you later, Mr. War God{alt: War God-san}.

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:34.740
Dad, who was that?

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.450
Who indeed.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.330
She's Leohart's older sister, apparently.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.550
But she's a big one.

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:43.480
She wiped out the entire council in a moment.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.260
Jeez, pulling these stunts.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:51.290
I didn't expect you to come this far, either.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.860
Now I can start seeing our path to peace.

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:57.180
This time the results turn out rather well.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.850
But honestly, it was all down to the wire.

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:05.030
I was able to fight against Leohart all thanks to you,

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:09.110
and I managed to defeat that demon
 only because I got Ramsus-san's help,

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:12.610
as well as cooperation from both Mio and Leohart.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.890
That's not what I mean.

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.700
Then what?

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:19.870
Well, forget about it.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.870
It's all over now.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.130
Yeah, it's over for now.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:34.050
I just hope this finally manages to free 
Mio from the demon realm's squabbles.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:37.780
Well, it'll work out somehow.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:40.140
Just as that young lady said...

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:43.090
the council's all gone now.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:49.350
Did you do this, Leo-kun?

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.940
It was like this when I arrived.

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:56.850
None of the subjugated women were able to reveal much at all.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:58.950
I don't have a clue what happened.

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:03.960
<i>This smells familiar.</i>

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.580
<i>This fragrance...</i>

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.170
<i>I see.</i>

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.460
<i>This is the smell of perfume.</i>

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:17.430
<i>Yes, if he killed Belphegor, 
then the council's influence would wane,</i>

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.430
<i>and war would die down in the demon realm.</i>

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:22.390
<i>But wait...</i>

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.550
<i>Then why would he need to fight Leo-kun?</i>

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:27.240
<i>If he missed a step,</i>

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:31.040
<i>it could have cost his precious comrades their lives, as well.</i>

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:34.170
<i>No, that's not right.</i>

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:41.310
Resolving this isn't as simple as just eliminating the council.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.540
Yeah...

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.750
Even if we proposed peace by offering up Belphegor's head,

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:50.670
the ones we surpassed would be even more wary of us.

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:55.050
That's why Basara risked his life against Leohart.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:18:01.600
Unveiling the council's plot and 
crushing it gives us a path to peace.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.570
If the demon realm's wars dwindle,

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:09.210
there'll be even fewer people going 
out of their way to pursue Mio-chan.

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:10.150
Yeah.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:13.220
It's not a bad deal for you, either.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:18.400
Your son has changed the history of the demon realm.

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:22.270
All for the sake of one precious sister.

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.080
I'm sorry, Leo-kun.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.750
Onee-chan might have messed up.

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.620
Elder sister?

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.540
Oh, well.

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:39.050
Let's go, Leo-kun!

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:41.630
Congratulations, Leo-kun!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:44.920
Once we're back in your room, 
I'll give you all the praise you deserve.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:46.210
Elder sister...

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:56.070
I can't believe you actually pulled it off.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.690
Whom are you planning to fight after this?

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:04.900
And I can't even believe you made me go this far.

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:06.080
Sorry.

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:08.410
You've already come this far.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.180
Finish it up well, Basacchi.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:12.580
Yeah.

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:03.470
<i>Even if I lose myself...</i>

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:11.520
<i>I'm already long...</i>

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:16.240
Mio?

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.950
Sorry, it's nothing.

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:22.720
It's a bit cold tonight.{It's cold out today.}

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:26.200
Warm me up,

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:28.280
Onii-chan.

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:39.170
Basara...

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.500
Onii-chan...

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.000
Onii-chan...

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.500
No, Please...

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:20.200
Like this?

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:23.750
T-That's not it..

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:28.740
N-Not there, you meanie...

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:34.950
G-Geez! Onii-chan...!

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:58.290
Mio...

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:02.570
Mio-sama!

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:07.400
The best thing for cold nights is hot, wet action!

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:09.730
You're like that all year-round!

00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:11.780
Kurumi, that outfit...

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:14.280
I-It's not what you think! Maria made me!

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:16.490
Naughty girls who make excuses

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:18.870
get this!

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:20.950
No!

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:22.610
H-Hey, what are you—

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:22.610
Hey!

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:23.870
Basara...

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:24.500
What are you doing?!

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:25.290
Yuki?

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:27.470
Let go of me!

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:27.470
Me, too, please...

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:31.240
Why, you!

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:31.890
Huh?

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:32.430
Stop that!

00:22:32.430 --> 00:22:33.470
Huh?

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:35.880
Does this feel good?

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:35.880
Hey!

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:37.940
Basara...

00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:38.860
Huh?

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:40.890
It's not fair if you only look at Onee!

00:22:40.060 --> 00:22:40.890
Me too...

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:44.890
Basara-niichan!

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:47.110
Hurry, Basara!

00:22:44.890 --> 00:22:46.950
Impressive, Basara-san!

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:49.130
Quite a nice look, too!

00:22:47.110 --> 00:22:48.280
Onee!

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:51.400
Now, for Kurumi-san, too!

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:51.400
Hey, me too!

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:56.250
Hey, hang on you guys!

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:58.910
Basara-sama, please, I beg you...

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:06.580
H-Hold on all of you.

00:23:06.580 --> 00:23:08.920
What are you all doing?!

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:11.350
He's my Basara!

00:23:11.350 --> 00:23:12.450
He's mine!

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:13.270
What?!

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:14.170
He's mine! Mine!

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:15.710
He's mine!

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:16.380
Mine!

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:17.930
Basara-sama!

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:19.130
You guys! Fine!

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:21.420
In that case, I'll relieve you all together!{What the hell is this show?}
